{
  "design_id": "T3-5",
  "tier": 3,
  "type": "PM",
  "description": "Branched multi-rail power management board without an MCU. TPS54331 converts 12V input to 5V. The 5V rail feeds TPS61088 to generate a boosted 12V load rail, AMS1117-3.3 to generate 3.3V, and TPS3703 to monitor the 5V rail. ME6211 converts 3.3V to 1.8V. TPS3703 outputs a single POWER_GOOD signal. This reduced benchmark focuses on branched power-tree distribution, rail isolation, boost/buck/LDO topology, and single-rail supervisor connection, not comparator-based sequencing or threshold design.",
  "ic_list": [
    "TPS54331 (U1)",
    "TPS61088 (U2)",
    "AMS1117-3.3 (U3)",
    "ME6211 (U4)",
    "TPS3703-Q1 (U5)"
  ],
